It seems like the focus is on a normalization of the long end here. Steepen the curve, let term premia expand, let financial conditions tighten through the long end and hope it plays out with enough runway that there's less need to change the short rate. 

This week's QRA will be crucial for understanding how aligned Treasury is with this new strategy.

@dampedspring latest piece was excellent on these matters and seems Andy is thinking in similar terms.

